  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The product contains all the non-3D printed parts for assembling an entirely functional AMS Flipper - for P1S/X1 Series. To complete the project, you also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To download the model files of the AMS Flipper - for P1S/X1 Series and obtain detailed information, please visit the AMS Flipper - for P1S/X1 Series on MakerWorld."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 30px;\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-=\"\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/4634a9a7fbe347118fa06123a11f44ae/20250529_Long_Demo_horizontal_video.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\">\n</video></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Overview</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The product contains all the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">non-3D printed</strong> parts for assembling an entirely functional <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">AMS Flipper - for P1S/X1 Series</strong>. To complete the project, you also need to download the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">model files</strong> and <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">3D print</strong> the remaining parts.<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">To download the model files of the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">AMS Flipper - for P1S/X1 Series</strong></span><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> and obtain detailed information, please visit the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">AMS Flipper - for P1S/X1 Series </strong></span><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">on </span><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/1363398-ams-flipper-better-access-to-your-p1s-x1c?from=search#profileId-1408595\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><u data-mce-fragment=\"1\">MakerWorld</u></strong></span></a><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">.</span></div>\n<!-- 第四条 -->\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">In the Box</h3>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 95px;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Item</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Qty</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\">\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\">\n<p>M3x30 FHCS Machine Screw (5PCS) - AA091</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Button\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+6\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib